OL,3,GNEWSAMystery letter to student found   
OL,4,Aduring hall refurb                     
OL,6,FAn old handwritten letter from a mother
OL,7,Fto her son has been discovered during  
OL,8,Frefurbishment work at the University of
OL,9,FNottingham.                            
OL,11,FAddressed to a man named Bill, it      
OL,12,Fcontains updates about his father and  
OL,13,Furges him to "settle down to work      
OL,14,Fagain".                                
OL,16,FOn the back of the letter, which was   
OL,17,Ffound between the floorboards, she     
OL,18,Foffers to send him a change of         
OL,19,Funderwear.                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
