OL,3,GNEWSAMystery letter to student found   
OL,4,Aduring hall refurb                     
OL,6,FIt is not clear when the letter was    
OL,7,Fwritten, although other items found    
OL,8,Fnearby during restoration work of Hugh 
OL,9,FStewart Hall on the campus included    
OL,10,Fnewspaper clippings from 1967, an empty
OL,11,Fbottle of strawberry-flavoured cream   
OL,12,Fsoda and a jar of glue.                
